# File drop (decision 061): a drag over the island shows the zones providers
# offer for it, whatever was showing; a drop on one opens its card and stays.

scenario: a drag opens Receptive from every resting state
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Idle
start media
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Compact
start timer
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Split

scenario: ...and over an alert, Home or a card
alert copied                        -> Alert
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Alert alert=copied
panel shelf
home                                -> Expanded expanded=home
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Expanded expanded=home

scenario: hidden wins over a drag
start media
hide                                -> Hidden
drag-enter                          -> Hidden
show                                -> Receptive

scenario: nobody takes it: nothing happens
start media
drag-rejected                       -> Compact

scenario: leaving and coming back within the grace is the same drag
start media
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy
hover copy                          -> Receptive zone=copy
drag-leave                          -> Receptive zone=none
wait 100
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy    -> Receptive
wait 100                            -> Receptive   # the grace was cancelled
drag-leave
wait 149                            -> Receptive
wait 1                              -> Compact

scenario: hovering names only zones of this drag
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy
hover copy                          -> zone=copy
hover other                         -> zone=none
hover link                          -> zone=link
hover none                          -> zone=none

scenario: a drop on a zone opens its card and stays open
panel shelf
start media
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy
hover copy
drop                                -> Expanded expanded=shelf
wait 7999                           -> Expanded expanded=shelf   # the idle clock starts at the drop
wait 1                              -> Compact

scenario: a drop on a greyed zone lands nothing
panel shelf
start media
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy!
drop copy                           -> Compact
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy!
hover copy                          -> zone=none  # greyed: it isn't hovered either
drop link                           -> Expanded expanded=shelf

scenario: sizes arriving can grey a zone
panel shelf
drag-enter shelf:link shelf:copy
hover copy                          -> zone=copy
drag-update shelf:link shelf:copy!  -> Receptive zone=none
drop copy                           -> Idle

scenario: a drag over a card leaves it as it was: draft and pin
panel timer keep
tile timer                          -> Expanded expanded=timer
focus timer add
type buy milk
pin                                 -> stay=yes
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Expanded expanded=timer draft=buy_milk stay=yes

scenario: a long drag doesn't time out the card under it
start media
click                               -> Expanded
drag-enter
wait 20000                          -> Receptive
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Expanded
wait 7999                           -> Expanded   # the idle clock starts when the drag ends
wait 1                              -> Compact

scenario: a critical alert during a drag closes the card once it ends
start media
click                               -> Expanded
drag-enter
alert fire critical                 -> Receptive queue=1
wait 1000                           -> Receptive  # the card stays under the drag
drag-leave
wait 150                            -> Alert alert=fire
